  "title": "Beautiful Modern 2 bed 2 bath unit at the Butterfly!! - apartments / housing for rent - craigslist",
  "bodyText": "CL\n\nvancouver, BC >\n\nvancouver >\n\nhousing >\n\napartments / housing for rent\n\npost\naccount\nreply \nfavorite\n \nhide\n \n⚐\nflag\n \n\nshare\n\nPosted 5 days ago\n\nprint\n$5,400 / 2br - 1181ft2 - Beautiful Modern 2 bed 2 bath unit at the Butterfly!! (Downtown Vancouver)\n© craigslist - Map data © OpenStreetMap\n\ngoogle map\n\n2BR / 2Ba 1181ft2\nrent period: monthly\ncats are OK - purrr\ncondo\ndogs are OK - wooof\nw/d in unit\nattached garage\nno smoking\nProperty Details:\n\nProperty ID: 5997\nLocation: #2406 - 1033 Nelson Street, Vancouver\nRent: $5,400 /mo\nAvailability: December 1st\nFurnished: Unfurnished\nBedroom: 2 Bedroom\nBathroom: 2 Bathroom\nSize of Area: 1181 sqft.\nPet: Upon Approval\nParking: 1 Included, additional space available at cost\nStorage Locker: Included\nUtilities: Not Included\nLease Term: Minimum 12 Month lease required.\n\n\nDescription:\nExperience luxury redefined in this stunning 2-bedroom, 2-bathroom home on the 24th floor of The Butterfly—an architectural icon by Revery Architecture, with breathtaking ocean and city views.\n\nThe home features a sleek, modern interior with top-of-the-line finishes, including a high-end kitchen equipped with Miele appliances, custom cabinetry, and quartz countertops. The open-concept layout is enhanced by elegant engineered hardwood flooring and a contemporary bathroom designed for comfort and style.\n\nResidents of The Butterfly enjoy access to an exceptional range of amenities, including a 24-hour concierge, swimming pool, fully equipped fitness centre, wellness centre with hydrotherapy, a tranquil music room with a grand piano, and beautifully designed lounge and social spaces.\n\nAny parking stall measurement/size to be verified by prospective tenants if applicable.**\n\n\n\n\nPlease contact Shahram at show contact info or reply to this ad to arrange your private viewing or inquire about the unit.\nPlease include your personal contact information for us to be able to assist you with your inquiry more promptly.\nDuring Weekend/Holidays, please call or text the leasing agent directly to arrange a showing.\n\n\nListing Brokerage: Vancouver Luxury Realty | Office Phone: show contact info\n\n** Professionally managed and marketed by Vancouver Luxury Realty. VLR does not charge prospective tenants any handling fees, application fees or processing fees. We are fully licensed with the Real Estate Council of British Columbia and simply act as the landlord/marketer for the owner. **\n\n**Any storage locker and parking stall measurement/size to be verified by prospective tenants if applicable.**\n\nMore info visit us @ www.vancouverluxuryrentals.com\n\n\npost id: 7994808651\n\n \n\nposted: 5 days ago\n\n \n\n♥ best of [?]\n\nhelp\nsafety\nprivacy\nterms\nabout\napp\n© 2026 craigslist",
